OL,3,AHead teacher evacuated 900 children
OL,4,Aminutes before Nepal floods hit school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA headteacher has told how he saved 900
OL,7,Fpupils' lives from the Nepal floods -
OL,8,Fby quickly evacuating them just 10
OL,9,Fminutes before the waters hit.
OL,11,FRajendra Dawadi, who is in charge of
OL,12,FTribhuvan Trishuli Secondary School in
OL,13,FNuwakot, told the BBC he had received
OL,14,Ffour calls at 09:10 local time (03:25
OL,15,FGMT) warning about the disaster, which
OL,16,Fhas now claimed at least 794 lives.
OL,18,FHe quickly decided to evacuate, telling
OL,19,Fthe children to run to higher ground
OL,20,Fand ordering buses full of students to
OL,21,Fturn around to flee the area.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
