OL,3,AHead teacher evacuated 900 children
OL,4,Aminutes before Nepal floods hit school
OL,5,
OL,6,FDawadi said: "If we didn't make a quick
OL,7,Fdecision, if it was 10 minutes later,
OL,8,Fwe all - including the students and me
OL,9,F- wouldn't be able to speak to you
OL,10,Ftoday."
